NOTES=Phase 3 = real-Signal interop: replace the INTERIM ACI-based SRTP HKDF identity binding (apps/user/war.signal/engine/src/call.rs identity_for()) with the REAL serialized identity public keys ringrtc uses (assumed 33-byte 0x05||X25519 from libsignal IdentityKey::serialize). Our identity = store.identity().identity_key().serialize(); peer identity = protocol store get_identity(peer ProtocolAddress) (async, in run()). caller=offerer first. ALSO randomize per-role ICE ufrag/pwd (currently fixed ufrAgentA/B in PeerSession::new_signal) for real interop. Test against a REAL Signal client (mirrors repros/call-browser). Carry-over refinements (not Phase 3 blockers): call timeout (unanswered rings forever); CallBar too thin/overlaps status bar (End hard to tap) -> taller in-call screen. Audio duplex MMAP -889 + NAT/TURN still unverified live.
